    // The subject may have been extended beyond range.end for
    // look-ahead purposes. The default implementation of
    // replace_with_captures_at appends the trailing haystack
    // content after the last match, which may include bytes
    // beyond range.end. Strip those extra bytes.
    if is_multi_line && subject.len() > range_end {
